        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose text-lg mb-6">An area rug is one of the most impactful yet affordable ways to transform a living room. The right rug anchors your furniture, adds warmth and texture, and ties your color scheme together. From plush shag to durable flatweave, the options are vast. This article features the 10 best area rugs for living rooms in 2026, across different styles and budgets.</p>
