        </tbody></table></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>Detailed Reviews</h2>
        <div class="space-y-12"><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">1</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">nuLOOM Moroccan Bled</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$79.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The nuLOOM Moroccan Bled is our top recommendation for most living rooms. Its hand-loomed construction and reversible design mean you get two rugs in one. The neutral Moroccan pattern works with almost any decor style, and at $79.99, it is an exceptional value. Note that it sheds for the first few weeks — vacuum regularly during this period.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Hand-loomed quality</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Reversible for double life</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Soft texture</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Great value</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Sheds initially</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Not pet-friendly</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">2</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Mohawk Home Stone Craft</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$129.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The Mohawk Home Stone Craft stands out for its StainGuard Plus technology, which repels spills and makes cleanup effortless. This is ideal for families with children or pets. The durable construction means it will maintain its appearance for years, even in high-traffic areas.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">StainGuard Plus protection</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Durable construction</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Easy to clean</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Multiple sizes</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Heavier weight</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Limited color palette</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">3</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Rugs USA Shag</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$59.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The Rugs USA Shag is the most budget-friendly option on this list at $59.99. Its 50mm extra-high pile is incredibly soft underfoot, making it perfect for bedrooms or cozy living spaces. Just be prepared for some initial shedding and avoid placing it in high-moisture areas.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Ultra-soft 50mm pile</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Budget-friendly</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Great for bedrooms</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Modern style</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Sheds significantly</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Hard to clean spills</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>How We Chose</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose mb-6">We evaluated 15 area rugs based on material quality, construction method, stain resistance, durability, ease of cleaning, aesthetic versatility, and value. We consulted interior designers and reviewed over 500 customer reviews to ensure our recommendations reflect real-world performance.</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>FAQ</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: What size area rug should I get for my living room?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">For a standard living room, an 8x10 rug is the most versatile size. It should be large enough that all furniture legs sit on the rug, or at least the front legs of your sofa and chairs. Measure your space before purchasing — an undersized rug can make a room feel cramped.</p></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: Which rug material is most suitable for high-traffic areas?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Natural fiber rugs like sisal and jute are durable but can show wear. Synthetic materials like polypropylene offer excellent stain resistance and are easier to clean. Wool is the premium choice — it is naturally stain-resistant, durable, and feels luxurious underfoot.</p></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: How do I clean and maintain an area rug?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Vacuum weekly (without a beater bar on delicate rugs). Address spills immediately by blotting, not rubbing. Professional cleaning is recommended every 12-18 months. Rotate your rug every few months to ensure even wear. Use a rug pad underneath to prevent slipping and extend rug life.</p></div></div>
        <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-primary/10 to-gold-light/10 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-gold-primary"><h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-4">Final Verdict</h2><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">For most living rooms, the <strong>nuLOOM Moroccan Bled</strong> at $79.99 offers the best combination of style, quality, and value. For families needing stain resistance, the <strong>Mohawk Home Stone Craft</strong> at $129.99 is the ideal choice.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6"><a href="#" class="btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon</a><a href="/blog" class="btn-gold-outline text-sm">More Reviews</a></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
